{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this DLC, you can enjoy &quot;Natsuki Karin,&quot; the second release in TOKYO6 ENTERTAINMENT's voice-synthesis character series. The character comes with two outfits\u2014summer (ponytail) and winter (twin tails)\u2014which can be switched at any time using the character change function. Additionally, as a feature exclusive to this DLC, &quot;Ekaterina&quot; (Natsuki Karin's official mascot) will appear when an alarm notification occurs, cutely informing you of the time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also features newly recorded voice lines by voice actress Miyu Takagi (affiliated with 81 Produce) and original motions. With a fresh ponytail for the summer outfit and twin tails for the winter outfit, you can enjoy a new side of Natsuki Karin unique to Desktop Mate as you switch between outfits and hairstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Mate is required to use this content. Please also ensure that you are using the latest version.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please use this content in accordance with the &quot;Character Usage Guidelines&quot; on the TOKYO6 ENTERTAINMENT official website.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to these guidelines, this content may be used for video distribution on platforms such as YouTube, NicoNico Douga, and Twitch.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Design: <strong>Nari Teshima</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Voice: <strong>Miyu Takagi</strong> (81 Produce)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base 3D Model: <strong>Tumidango</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contents included in this product</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Natsuki Karin</p>","background":"https: